    "verification_claim": "M0-M2 and MI-01 through MI-07 and MI-09 have fresh luna_self_verified receipts for source tree 981aec9c. M3 and MI-08 are BLOCKED pending a fresh eight-cell hosted platform matrix and current M3 aggregate. The solo-owner production approval configuration is live-verified on pypi-production: the owner is the required reviewer, self-approval is allowed, administrator bypass is disabled, and only main is permitted. M4 remains BLOCKED on confirmed PyPI/TestPyPI ownership and login, trusted publishers, the pypi-test environment, explicit exact-candidate authorization, and actual TestPyPI/PyPI upload/download/install proof. No package has been published."
